{"id":"1c788260abb68912","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-pi-type-syntax.md","title":"df-pi-type","display":"df-pi-type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-pi-type-syntax","aliases":["16-df-pi-type-syntax","Pi type"],"display":"df-pi-type","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-signature]]"],"source":"§10.1 pp.586–588 (PDF606–608)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-pi-type-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-pi-type-syntax</span><span>Pi type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi-type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.1 pp.586–588 (PDF606–608)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a> 的原始语法、型属注释和判断闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}\">\\(\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}\\)</span>，变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 新鲜；构造子的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,x.B)\">\\((A,x.B)\\)</span> 可依该文件约定省略。</li>\n<li>下式为依赖积的形成、引入、消去和判断转换规则；各分式按元层规则模式读取。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,f\">\\(a,b,f\\)</span> 在相应规则前提给出的型属中取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi(x:A).B:\\mathsf{Ty}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash b:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_{A,x.B}(x.b):\\Pi(x:A).B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi(x:A).B:\\mathsf{Ty}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash b:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_{A,x.B}(x.b):\\Pi(x:A).B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi(x:A).B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.B}(f,a):B[a/x]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi(x:A).B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.B}(f,a):B[a/x]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda(x:A).b,a)= b[a/x]:B[a/x]},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi(x:A).B\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(f)}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda(x:A).\\operatorname{app}(f,x)= f:\\Pi(x:A).B}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda(x:A).b,a)= b[a/x]:B[a/x]},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi(x:A).B\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(f)}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda(x:A).\\operatorname{app}(f,x)= f:\\Pi(x:A).B}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§10.1 pp.586–588（PDF606–608）。语法规则不直接断言某个候选语义函子已经有右伴随；范畴条件另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b2cc14b2a23ac\" href=\"?note=e67b2cc14b2a23ac\" title=\"16-df-dependent-product\">16-df-dependent-product</a>，该条件需要理解投影、选定伴随与 BC。这里保留完整 β/η 型属和新鲜变量条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-dtt-signature]] 的原始语法、型属注释和判断闭包。$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}$、$\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}$，变量 $x$ 新鲜；构造子的下标 $(A,x.B)$ 可依该文件约定省略。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-product","status":"resolved","id":"e67b2cc14b2a23ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：§10.1 pp.586–588（PDF606–608）。语法规则不直接断言某个候选语义函子已经有右伴随；范畴条件另见 [[16-df-dependent-product]]，该条件需要理解投影、选定伴随与 BC。这里保留完整 β/η 型属和新鲜变量条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"(A,x.B)","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,f","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Ty}\\quad\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash B:\\mathsf{Ty}}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\Pi(x:A).B:\\mathsf{Ty}},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash b:B}{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda_{A,x.B}(x.b):\\Pi(x:A).B}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi(x:A).B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}_{A,x.B}(f,a):B[a/x]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{\\Gamma,x:A\\vdash b:B\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:A}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda(x:A).b,a)= b[a/x]:B[a/x]},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi(x:A).B\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(f)}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda(x:A).\\operatorname{app}(f,x)= f:\\Pi(x:A).B}.","display":true}],"bytes":1618,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-291","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pi-type-syntax|df-pi-type]]"}],"outgoing":["3b1238220cc5942f","e67b2cc14b2a23ac"]}